{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000763","bookName":"Después de 99 veces que terminamos","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000000763/42000000763.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":4658390,"followCount":79913,"introduction":"Nora amó a José durante muchos años. Tras casarse, se vio repetidamente amenazada con el divorcio, obligada una y otra vez a ceder y tratar de salvar la relación. No fue hasta que descubrió las cartas de amor que José guardaba en secreto que comprendió que él la amaba de verdad, pero se divertía torturando su corazón. Desanimada y con el corazón roto, decidió aceptar el divorcio por 99ª vez y marcharse de manera definitiva. ","chapterCount":71,"labels":["Toxic Love","Love After Divorce"],"tags":["Toxic Love","Love After Divorce"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Después-de-99-veces-que-terminamos","bookNameLower":"después-de-99-veces-que-terminamos","shelfTime":"2025-11-27 19:08:56","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-27 19:08:56","performerList":[{"performerId":"28708","performerName":"Fujie Huang","performerFormatName":"Fujie-Huang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/8x0/28708/28708.jpg?time=1785750140428","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"19445","performerName":"Xiaoxi Ge","performerFormatName":"Xiaoxi-Ge","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/5x4/19445/19445.jpg?time=1790055612510","videoCount":6}],"performerIdList":[19445,28708]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700048618","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/81/3x6/36x7/367x0/36700000024/700048618_1/700048618.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=QTpOdh5hdutPigUBpip~UZhZ55fbitVdHiyguiLqkkXbpIQwP6i0X48Hoptmr2gFwaHMlsgztZAOIQJpEWJJvmbal5tWi8WXddRbsQE8DApjJezNzw6TZ1DauJx4STUBCQ1MtjJo4Qm10x5YN-myofqlvqpBF5hmUGZoyFHgsBz